<p>Something to add.<br />
The way to prevent an uprising is to end it before it begins properly which is why surveillance is the key.<br />
It's rather like precipitation in a liquid - until a critical size of a &quot;blob&quot; of new phase is reached, it will &quot;redissolve&quot; before it enters stable growth.<br />
And once you reach a certain level of technology, making sure that doesn't happen isn't that difficult.</p>

