<p>Um&#8230; well, for starters, it's pretty much impossible (okay, exceedingly unlikely, given how &quot;impossible&quot; tends to fare in SCP-verse) to have neuroscience advanced enough to make Charisma Cap and surgery / MMI / immunology / robotics / etc. etc. advanced enough to build cyborgs, while still <em>literally</em> following humors model <em>(whether U-folk really do that is up to interpretation forever, since, you know, no canon)</em>, unless you're getting the cool gadgetry from outside source.</p>
